# Root cleanliness - Amendment 014/017: Seven-file MD whitelist
/*.md
!README.md
!CODEBASE_MAP.md
!SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md
!PROJECT_CHARTER.md
!DAILY_CONTEXT.md
!IMPLEMENTATION_ROADMAP.md
